    "status": "present",
    "value": "Each invoice can be matched at most once; payments are processed in order. A memo reference to an existing, still unmatched invoice matches it. Otherwise (no reference, unknown id, or already matched) the payment falls back to the unmatched invoice with exactly the same amount and the earliest dueDate (YYYY-MM-DD), ties by invoiceId ascending; if none, null."
  },
